    <ns0:title>b12227: tests : keep dummy ffn.act scales away from zero (#31940)</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;p&gt;The dummy-model generator fills every tensor from a plain normal pool.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;blk.N.ffn.act.scales&lt;/code&gt; is a divisor in the mpt graph, so with seed&lt;br&gt;
1224489258 it draws |v| ~ 1e-6, and &lt;code&gt;ffn_act = gelu(...) / scales&lt;/code&gt; reaches&lt;br&gt;
2.7e5. Metal stages both operands of &lt;code&gt;kernel_mul_mm_f32_f32&lt;/code&gt; as half, so&lt;br&gt;
those activations overflow to inf, the norm downstream turns t</ns0:content>
